flowchart TB
  Citizen[Citizen] --> Browser[React Web App]
  Officer[Officer / Reviewer] --> Browser
  Admin[Department / Platform Admin] --> Browser
  Browser -->|HTTPS REST| API[Spring Boot Modular Monolith]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> Storage[(Private Object Storage)]
  API -. optional .-> Redis[(Redis)]
  API -. outbox/events .-> Worker[Background Worker]
  Worker -. optional .-> Kafka[(Kafka)]
  Worker --> Email[Email Provider]
  API --> Metrics[Actuator / Micrometer]
  Metrics --> Prom[Prometheus]
  Prom --> Grafana[Grafana]
